      "writtenOn": "2022-07-19T23:21:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s the terminology that base:: (and Python, https://docs.python.org/3/library/os.path.html#os.path.basename) uses. Happy to use either, but basename is a bit more concise.\n\nEventually we want to use RESOLVE_NO_SYMLINKS which would block symlinks anywhere in the path, hence this function specifying that it only looks for symlinks in the basename.",
      "parentUuid": "0e6ff637_6d2c635e",
      "revId": "a50a0d0db0efc5d5d6f6bc1d8e040d8ee969f59c",
